@startuml UC-06
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-06.md
title UC-06: Reset Password
footer Feature AUTH-06 | Business rules: BR-02, BR-05
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Guest" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "AuthController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "AuthService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
participant "IPasswordHasher" as HASH <<Daisy.Infrastructure>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Open reset link (token in URL)
MVC --> U : Show new password form
U -> MVC : Submit new password + confirmation
alt passwords do not match
  MVC --> U : Show "Passwords do not match"
else passwords match
  MVC -> API : POST /api/auth/reset-password { token, newPassword }
  API -> SVC : ResetPasswordAsync(request)
  SVC -> DB : Find user by reset token
  alt token invalid or ResetPasswordExpiresAt passed
    SVC --> API : BadRequest
    API --> MVC : 400 Bad Request
    MVC --> U : Show "Link is invalid or expired, request a new one"
  else token valid
    SVC -> HASH : HashPassword(newPassword) (BR-02)
    HASH --> SVC : passwordHash
    SVC -> DB : Update PasswordHash\nClear ResetPasswordToken + expiry\nClear RefreshToken (BR-05)\nSaveChangesAsync
    SVC --> API : OK
    API --> MVC : 204 No Content
    MVC --> U : Redirect to login with success message
  end
end

@enduml
